# G5.2: against a real engine -- a compound binding, opened in the Inspector.
# M-x view.inspector rather than a count of Tabs, so the script says what it
# means and does not depend on the order of the tiles.
type route( hall, step( kitchen, step( cellar, [ 1, 2, 3 ] ) ) );
Enter
type route( $from, $path )
Enter
M-x
type view.inspector
Enter
Down
Right
Down
Down
Right
